"This page will show you how to setup a Raspberry Pi (RPi) as a gateway to"
" a 3DR Telemetry Radio. This will allow you to connect a computer or "
"tablet via WiFi to the Raspberry Pi, and the Raspberry Pi will in turn "
"forward the communication to a drone through a telemetry link."
